---
import HalftoneScene from "./HalftoneScene.astro";
---

<section id="services">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="vision-grid">
      <div>
        <h3 class="sub forge">The Craft</h3>
        <p class="lead">
          <strong>Giedi</strong> is an onchain data forge. We take the raw ore of block data,
          transactions, logs, traces, bridges, and beat it into dashboards, reports and models a
          team can actually use. Growth, tokenomics, security, incentives.
        </p>
        <p class="lead">
          Onchain data is the truth layer of the next cycle. Every protocol deserves a tailored
          view of its own reality, forged by people who read the chain for a living.
        </p>
        <div class="kicker">SERVICES</div>
        <p class="note">
          ▸ Dune dashboards &amp; spellbook contributions<br />
          ▸ On-chain research &amp; written reports<br />
          ▸ Tokenomics &amp; incentive analysis<br />
          ▸ Custom data pipelines, ETL, APIs, webhooks<br />
          ▸ Growth &amp; BD analytics for protocols
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="vision-piece">
        <HalftoneScene kind="hammer" size="lg" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
